  "scope": "Full onsite positive-metric affine kinematics can be represented on growing finite symmetric spin blocks with fixed-input Galerkin convergence. The analytical theorem controls bounded metric functions, Lie brackets and finite affine transformations, not unbounded inverse-metric moments, spatial constraints, a uniformly local parent or an Einstein phase. Affine quantization is established prior work; no physical TOE is proved."
